"In both instances, your firm failed to initiate an investigation to determine the root cause of the invalidated runs."}]}, "affected_work": {"status": "found", "value": "채혈 부위 준비와 채혈 절차, 무효화된 검체가 발생한 검사 실행에 대한 조사, 헌혈 과정에서 이상반응을 겪은 공여자의 후속 관리, Anti-Hepatitis C Virus System 검사 작업 절차가 대상이다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "The venipuncture sites were prepared using and that are labeled as \"Non-sterile Solution.\""}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "Your firm does not have written procedures governing donor follow-up activities for donors who experienced adverse reactions during the donation process."}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "Your firm’s current procedure titled, “Anti- Hepatitis C Virus System” (Version 1.0, Effective date: 1/19/2021), does not contain detailed instructions for performing testing operations."}]}, "recommendation": {"status": "found", "value": "FDA는 관찰사항에 이의가 있거나 관련 시정조치를 시행했거나 계획한 경우 실사 중 담당자와 논의하거나 해당 정보를 FDA에 제출할 수 있다고 안내한다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "If you have an objection regarding an observation, or have implemented, or plan to implement, corrective action in response to an observation, you may discuss the objection or action with the FDA representative(s) during the inspection or submit this information to FDA at the address above."}]}, "effective_date": {"status": "not_stated", "value": "", "evidence": []}, "response_deadline": {"status": "not_stated", "value": "", "evidence": []}, "reviewed_at": "2026-10-19", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "source_url": "https://www.fda.gov/media/193616/download", "scope": "확보한 본문 기준 · 첨부 및 미확보 페이지는 제외 · 자동 추출"}, "content_scope": "case", "scope_reason": "실무 관련성 검토 필요", "topics": ["sterility", "quality-system"], "classification_method": "source-keywords-v1", "classification_status": "rule_matched", "inspection_end_date": "2025-08-29", "official_published_at": "2026-07-14", "first_seen_at": "2026-09-15", "last_collected_at": "2026-09-29", "collection_mode": "daily", "investigator